nique-normal-form</a>；工作于ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convergent}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists! b\\in A\\;(a\\to^*b\\land\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Convergent}(A,\\to)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\exists! b\\in A\\;(a\\to^*b\\land\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是上述原书结果的局部推论，已复核：终止性给存在性，合流性给唯一性。不引入在非弱正规化项上未定义的全函数nf。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"eb3dc4a04164786f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-convergent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"e295b2b3159f2b40","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-sn-implies-wn","status":"resolved","id":"2242dbd4d93961ea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-sn-implies-wn]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-termination-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"e492786084299d72","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-termination-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"84b767b970cfd3a0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-confluent-implies-unique-normal-form]]","embed":false